  "question": {
    "text": "The set of points on the axis of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> from which all the three normals drawn to the parabola are real and distinct, is",
