      "text": "<math><mo>{</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>}</mo></math>",
